--   TRIAL III (Part 5): builders[3] = final obby (4 lanes, 3 half-spirals, crumbling / sliding / spinning-bar obstacles); arenas[3] =
--     V.Trials.startDemonFight(ctx, K.TRIAL_ARENAS[3]): demon orb in a pit behind the arena, phase 1 (waves, medium orbs = 2 rock hits, three red
--     shield orbs joined by fire lines, 3 sword hits each) and phase 2 (meteors, blue ones are struck towards the demon orb with the camera aimed at it,
--     then the shield orbs again). Boss bar: 3 sections, right one drains first (bossP). PHASE 3 + ANGEL ENDING = PART 6: replace finishPart5()
